@startuml sequence-register-enroll
title Registering a student and enrolling in a course
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber

actor User
participant ConsoleApp
participant SchoolFacade
participant "access: Access" as Access
participant PersonRegistry
participant StudentCreator
participant EnrollmentService
participant EventBus

User -> ConsoleApp : 3 Add person (student)
ConsoleApp -> SchoolFacade : register(access, STUDENT, id, name)
SchoolFacade -> Access : require(MANAGE_PEOPLE)
SchoolFacade -> PersonRegistry : register(STUDENT, id, name)
PersonRegistry -> StudentCreator : register(id, name)
StudentCreator -> StudentCreator : create(id, name)
StudentCreator --> PersonRegistry : Student
PersonRegistry --> SchoolFacade : Student
SchoolFacade -> EventBus : publish(PERSON_REGISTERED)
ConsoleApp --> User : Person registered.

User -> ConsoleApp : 6 Enroll student
ConsoleApp -> SchoolFacade : enroll(access, studentId, courseCode)
SchoolFacade -> Access : require(ENROLL)
SchoolFacade -> EnrollmentService : course(courseCode)
SchoolFacade -> PersonRegistry : student(studentId)
SchoolFacade -> SchoolFacade : check prerequisites
SchoolFacade -> EnrollmentService : enroll(studentId, course)
SchoolFacade -> EventBus : publish(STUDENT_ENROLLED)
ConsoleApp --> User : Enrollment completed.
@enduml
